This is an updated version of my menucolors patch.

The patch allows menu lines to be colored according to rules set up
in your config file, eg.

OPTIONS=menucolors
MENUCOLOR=" blessed "=green
MENUCOLOR=" holy "=green
MENUCOLOR=" cursed "=red
MENUCOLOR=" unholy "=red

would show all items known to be blessed or holy with green,
and all items known to be cursed or unholy with red.

This new version allows to use standard regex, instead of just
GNU regex, so it should compile with DJGPP and *BSD.
Thanks to Jilles Tjoelker for this.

(Actually, this 'new' version has been sitting on my HD for half
a year, so it's a bit old already, sorry 'bout that ;)

